1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,197
ComfyUI, designed for your phone.

2
00:00:02,197 --> 00:00:04,354
Write a prompt, explore your results,

3
00:00:04,354 --> 00:00:07,589
and keep creating with an interface built for touch.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,813
The prompt bar stays at the bottom, within easy reach.

5
00:00:12,813 --> 00:00:16,227
Choose a workflow, aspect ratio, and up to four results

6
00:00:16,227 --> 00:00:17,592
in one compact menu.

7
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,789
Tap an image and describe your change.

8
00:00:21,789 --> 00:00:22,813
Swipe through versions.

9
00:00:22,813 --> 00:00:25,544
Your last viewed version becomes the gallery cover,

10
00:00:25,544 --> 00:00:27,592
and the original is still there.

11
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,105
Want motion?

12
00:00:30,105 --> 00:00:32,220
Open Animate on that same image.

13
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,687
Add a motion prompt, choose your settings,

14
00:00:34,687 --> 00:00:37,507
and MiniMax H3 turns it into video.

15
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,657
Stop rebuilding the same references.

16
00:00:41,657 --> 00:00:46,623
Fragments keep a character, object, style, or place ready to reuse,

17
00:00:46,623 --> 00:00:50,685
with text, images, and model specific LoRA settings together.

18
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:56,359
Turn an image into composition boxes, depth, or line maps.

19
00:00:56,359 --> 00:00:59,525
Tap an object to select it with SAM,

20
00:00:59,525 --> 00:01:01,505
then save a reusable Fragment.

21
00:01:01,505 --> 00:01:03,088
Support varies by workflow.

22
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:07,723
In Prompter, your draft stays ready for the next try.

23
00:01:07,723 --> 00:01:10,049
Keep your favorites, group them into projects,

24
00:01:10,049 --> 00:01:13,040
and reuse the full recipe instead of starting over.

25
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,670
The touch interface is native Android.

26
00:01:16,670 --> 00:01:20,452
A Windows connector sends workflow graphs to the ComfyUI API,

27
00:01:20,452 --> 00:01:24,235
tracks the queue, and brings results back to the app.

28
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,171
Pair your phone with the desktop connector.

29
00:01:28,171 --> 00:01:31,734
Use your existing ComfyUI installation or a separate one,

30
00:01:31,734 --> 00:01:36,088
with local network access and optional Tailscale when you are away.

31
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,629
Less setup between ideas.

32
00:01:38,629 --> 00:01:40,166
More creating on your phone.

33
00:01:40,166 --> 00:01:43,240
From a prompt to an edit and a moving shot,

34
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:45,699
bwdacc keeps your tools together.